  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Interest in Parkour Event</h2>\n<p>The speaker is clearly interested in the parkour event, as evidenced by their enthusiastic statement, &#x27;I&#x27;m a big fan of that!&#x27; They also express excitement about creating a special parkour course, saying, &#x27;We&#x27;re gonna make us a special parkour course!&#x27; This indicates a strong interest in the event and its development.</p>\n<p>Fuwamoko is mentioned as a potential participant in the parkour event. The speaker says, &#x27;Fuwamoko!&#x27; and suggests that they might be able to play it, indicating that Fuwamoko could be involved in the event.</p>\n<p>The parkour course will involve a lot of tumbling, as the speaker mentions, &#x27;Tumble all over the place...&#x27; This suggests that tumbling is a key component of the course design.</p>\n<p>The parkour event is scheduled to take place at 8 PM PT. This is confirmed in multiple statements, including &#x27;Make sure that you make it by...&#x27; and &#x27;At... 8PM... PT!&#x27; This indicates that the event is set for the 24th at 8 PM PT.</p>\n<p>The speaker repeatedly affirms their agreement with various statements, as seen in multiple &#x27;Yeah!&#x27; responses. These affirmations suggest a general agreement or enthusiasm for the topics being discussed.</p>\n<h2>Safety Concerns Regarding Objects</h2>\n<p>The objects in question are not poisonous, as stated, &#x27;They&#x27;re not poisonous.&#x27; However, their exact nature is unknown, with the speaker saying, &#x27;We don&#x27;t know.&#x27; This uncertainty raises concerns about their properties.</p>\n<p>The objects may have an unknown property, as suggested by the statement, &#x27;It could be.&#x27; This uncertainty is further emphasized by the remark, &#x27;It might be,&#x27; which implies that the objects could potentially pose a risk.</p>\n<p>The objects may have an uncertain effect, as indicated by the statement, &#x27;It could be.&#x27; This uncertainty leads to the recommendation that caution is advised when dealing with these objects.</p>\n<p>To ensure safety, it is recommended to avoid direct contact with the objects, as stated, &#x27;It might be better not to touch them.&#x27; This advice is given due to the uncertainty surrounding the objects&#x27; properties.</p>\n<p>The objects are described as fluffy, as mentioned in the statement, &#x27;Fluffy.&#x27; This description adds to the uncertainty about their nature and potential effects.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_7OUE2xsu70</p>",
